        BST1["BUYER STAGE TAGS - One active at a time<br>buyer:awareness - on bridge entry (E.1-E.7 first step)<br>buyer:education - on indoc link click or email open #2+<br>buyer:vendor-comparison - on VSL 50%+ or solution pitch engaged<br>buyer:decision - on booking page visit or micro-qualifier started<br>buyer:post-decision - on deal won<br>USE FOR: reporting | retargeting ad audiences | messaging gates | sales scripting<br>Seinfeld broadcast: only sends to buyer:education or buyer:vendor-comparison<br>BEHAVIORAL STATE TAGS (NEW v6.11) - detected by engagement patterns, not sequence position<br>buyer-state:curious-skeptical - opens but never clicks (increase social proof)<br>buyer-state:interested-distracted - irregular engagement (pattern interrupt + channel switch)<br>buyer-state:ready-hesitant - high engagement + booking page visit + no book (MOMENTUM CAPTURE)<br>buyer-state:comparing - competitor link clicks, delayed responses (positioning content)<br>buyer-state:stalled - was engaged, now 14+ days silent (sprint reactivation)<br>buyer-state:negative - unsubscribe/negative reply/objection (O.0 or suppress)<br>NEGATIVE SIGNAL TAGS + ROUTING (NEW v6.12):<br>neg-signal:message-mismatch - opens no clicks (switch story arc in next message)<br>neg-signal:trust-gap - clicks no book (inject SA2 authority + guarantee)<br>neg-signal:urgency-gap - watches no action (inject sprint burst + external constraint)<br>neg-signal:commitment-anxiety - books then cancels (Environment Change reinforcement)<br>neg-signal:distracted - engaged then silent 7+ days (channel switch + pattern interrupt)<br>neg-signal:explicit-stop - unsubscribe or stop request (suppress all automation)<br>GHL IMPLEMENTATION: Add IF/ELSE branch in Behavioral State Detector<br>  After checking positive states, check for negative patterns<br>  Apply neg-signal:* tag | trigger remediation workflow<br>  BUILD: Negative Signal Remediation Workflow<br>    Trigger: contact_tag = neg-signal:*<br>    Branch by signal type: each branch applies specific fix<br>    message-mismatch: update story arc preference field, change next email template<br>    trust-gap: remove from current sequence, add to positioning content (SA2+SA3)<br>    urgency-gap: remove from sequence, fire sprint burst immediately<br>    commitment-anxiety: add to Environment Change reinforcement sequence<br>    distracted: wait 7d, switch channel, fire pattern interrupt<br>    explicit-stop: add to DNC suppress list, remove from all workflows<br>GHL IMPLEMENTATION: BUILD utility workflow - Behavioral State Detector<br>  Trigger: scheduled (runs every 48h per active contact) OR contact_changed on engagement fields<br>  Logic: IF/ELSE branches checking last 7 days of engagement patterns<br>  Output: apply/update buyer-state:* tag<br>  PRIORITY RULE: Behavioral state OVERRIDES sequence position for content selection<br>  Example: prospect in S2.0 with buyer-state:ready-hesitant = skip to Momentum Capture<br>  Example: prospect in S3.x with buyer-state:comparing = force SA3 positioning content"]
