        HSO1["MESSAGING + STORY + TRUST + MOMENTUM STANDARDS<br>HSO (Rec #4): Hook+Story+Offer for every touchpoint<br>Diagnosis: low opens=hook | low CTR=story | low conv=offer<br>AC (Rec #2): persona in all messaging<br>VL (Rec #1): ascension at every stage<br>STORY ARC LIBRARY: 5 core arcs (SA1-SA5) deployed per Deployment Matrix<br>TRUST ESCALATION: 6 levels mapped to funnel columns<br>Never ask for commitment beyond current trust level<br>Seinfeld (Rec #3): PUBLISHED (ID: 40d77229) - audit needed<br>HOT1 (Rec #6): fast-tracks L1-L3 to L4<br>MOMENTUM LAYER (v6.13) - DS ALIGNED:<br>  Extends DS Rec #6 (Hyperactive Buyer) to all engagement signals<br>  Extends DS Phase 5 (Identify Hyperactive Buyers) to real-time event response<br>  MOMENTUM LAYER:<br>  Every touchpoint is DUAL-TRACK: advance sequence + offer booking escape hatch<br>  Mid-tier acceleration: score 25-50 in 7d = pause drip + rep task + booking SMS<br>  Hesitation detector: booking page visit without booking = follow-up<br>  Readiness signals detected, not just trust levels measured<br>REFERRAL OVERLAY (NEW v6.10):<br>  Referral asks fire at 5 lifecycle moments, not just post-inspection<br>  Tag-triggered utility workflow fires on satisfaction spike signals<br>SPEED-TO-LEAD (v6.14 FINAL):<br>  Tier A/B: call within 5 min, SMS if missed in 60s<br>  Tier C: call within 30 min, indoc in parallel<br>  Tier D: automated SMS in 5 min, call within 2h, full indoc immediately<br>  No amount of content compensates for slow first contact<br>OFFER-DRIVEN REACTIVATION:<br>  S1.1 leads with external constraint (timing, scarcity, cost) not just stories<br>  Story arcs select emotional angle. External constraints drive the CTA."]
        LP_INT["LP INTEGRATION LAYER<br>RAILWAY/NODE.JS SINGLE SERVICE (not n8n) per LP MCP Server Spec v5<br>LEAD PERFECTION = system of record | GHL = marketing automation layer<br>SYNC ARCHITECTURE:<br>1. LP to Supabase Mirror - Railway Node.js service<br>   Tables: lp_leads | lp_jobs | lp_call_logs | lp_notes | lp_activities<br>   lp_dispositions | lp_job_milestones | lp_source_mapping | lp_sync_log<br>   Incremental sync every 15 min via GetLeadData + GetJobStatusChanges<br>   Full sync as needed via GetLead<br>2. LP MCP Server - 33 tool functions via HighLevel MCP + LP MCP<br>3. LP to GHL Trigger Map (via Railway sync + Supabase):<br>   LP milestone Install Completed - fire C.3 Referral Request<br>   LP milestone F (install end) - fire C.2 Post-Install Check-In<br>   LP milestone C (completion) - fire C.4 Review Solicitation<br>   LP milestone B (inspection passed) - fire C.5 Referral Program<br>   LP Financing Denied - route to Recycle pipeline<br>   LP Closed Lost - suppress all GHL sequences immediately<br>   LP Permit/HOA Pending - pause GHL marketing automation<br>   LP Day 15 Inactive - LP Disposition Gate entry<br>   LP Days Inactive 90+ AND not closed - surface to S1.1<br>SYNC HEALTH (March 2026):<br>   37,720 Day 15+ prospects never triggered - backfill required (highest priority)<br>   3,100 milestone triggers unfired - build C.x urgently<br>   213 unmapped LP sources - ongoing maintenance required<br>PHASE 2 (future scope):<br>   GHL to LP write-back at Appointment Completed<br>   AI contact summaries from full activity history<br>   Revenue attribution model"]
